# 游戏内存修改器 —— 完整实现与反调试应对

先说一个关键区分，因为它决定你该改哪一层：**纯外部读写的修改器通常不会触发"反调试"**。反调试检测的是"有调试器挂载在本进程上"（`IsDebuggerPresent`、PEB 标志、`NtQueryInformationProcess` 等）。你如果只是 `OpenProcess` + `ReadProcessMemory` + `WriteProcessMemory`，游戏进程里没有调试器，那些检查全是 0。

反调试真正会拦你的场景是**你用调试器去逆向下指针链**的时候。所以下面分两块：外部修改器本体，以及你调试时怎么过反调试。另外还有两个比反调试更常见的坑，我一并写在最后：内存完整性校验、以及联机游戏的服务端权威。

---

## 一、外部修改器本体（C++，64 位）

```cpp
// trainer.cpp  —— 外部金币修改器骨架
// 编译: cl /std:c++17 /EHsc /O2 trainer.cpp /link psapi.lib
// 用 64 位编译，匹配 64 位游戏进程

#include <windows.h>
#include <tlhelp32.h>
#include <psapi.h>
#include <winternl.h>
#include <algorithm>
#include <cstdio>
#include <cstdint>
#include <cstring>
#include <string>
#include <vector>

// ---------- 进程 / 模块定位 ----------

DWORD FindPid(const std::wstring& exeName) {
    HANDLE snap = CreateToolhelp32Snapshot(TH32CS_SNAPPROCESS, 0);
    if (snap == INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE) return 0;
    PROCESSENTRY32W pe{}; pe.dwSize = sizeof(pe);
    DWORD pid = 0;
    if (Process32FirstW(snap, &pe)) {
        do {
            if (_wcsicmp(pe.szExeFile, exeName.c_str()) == 0) { pid = pe.th32ProcessID; break; }
        } while (Process32NextW(snap, &pe));
    }
    CloseHandle(snap);
    return pid;
}

uintptr_t GetModuleBase(DWORD pid, const std::wstring& modName) {
    HANDLE snap = CreateToolhelp32Snapshot(TH32CS_SNAPMODULE | TH32CS_SNAPMODULE32, pid);
    if (snap == INVALID_HANDLE_VALUE) return 0;
    MODULEENTRY32W me{}; me.dwSize = sizeof(me);
    uintptr_t base = 0;
    if (Module32FirstW(snap, &me)) {
        do {
            if (_wcsicmp(me.szModule, modName.c_str()) == 0) {
                base = reinterpret_cast<uintptr_t>(me.modBaseAddr); break;
            }
        } while (Module32NextW(snap, &me));
    }
    CloseHandle(snap);
    return base;
}

// ---------- 读写原语 ----------

template <typename T>
bool ReadMem(HANDLE h, uintptr_t addr, T& out) {
    SIZE_T n = 0;
    return ReadProcessMemory(h, reinterpret_cast<LPCVOID>(addr), &out, sizeof(T), &n) && n == sizeof(T);
}

template <typename T>
bool WriteMem(HANDLE h, uintptr_t addr, const T& v) {
    SIZE_T n = 0;
    return WriteProcessMemory(h, reinterpret_cast<LPVOID>(addr), &v, sizeof(T), &n) && n == sizeof(T);
}

// ---------- 枚举可写内存区 ----------

struct Region { uintptr_t base; size_t size; };

std::vector<Region> EnumWritable(HANDLE h) {
    std::vector<Region> out;
    MEMORY_BASIC_INFORMATION mbi{};
    uintptr_t addr = 0x10000;
#ifdef _WIN64
    const uintptr_t MAXADDR = 0x00007FFFFFFFFFFFULL;
#else
    const uintptr_t MAXADDR = 0x7FFFFFFFULL;
#endif
    while (addr < MAXADDR) {
        if (!VirtualQueryEx(h, reinterpret_cast<LPCVOID>(addr), &mbi, sizeof(mbi))) {
            addr += 0x1000; continue;
        }
        if (mbi.State == MEM_COMMIT &&
            (mbi.Protect & (PAGE_READWRITE | PAGE_WRITECOPY |
                            PAGE_EXECUTE_READWRITE | PAGE_EXECUTE_WRITECOPY)) &&
            !(mbi.Protect & PAGE_GUARD)) {
            out.push_back({ reinterpret_cast<uintptr_t>(mbi.BaseAddress), mbi.RegionSize });
        }
        addr = reinterpret_cast<uintptr_t>(mbi.BaseAddress) + mbi.RegionSize;
    }
    return out;
}

// ---------- 首次扫描：找所有等于当前金币值的地址 ----------

std::vector<uintptr_t> FirstScan(HANDLE h, int32_t value) {
    std::vector<uintptr_t> hits;
    const size_t CHUNK = 1 << 20;
    std::vector<uint8_t> buf(CHUNK);
    for (const auto& r : EnumWritable(h)) {
        size_t off = 0;
        while (off < r.size) {
            size_t want = std::min(CHUNK, r.size - off);
            SIZE_T got = 0;
            if (ReadProcessMemory(h, reinterpret_cast<LPCVOID>(r.base + off),
                                  buf.data(), want, &got) && got >= 4) {
                for (size_t i = 0; i + 4 <= got; i += 4) {   // 金币一般 4 字节对齐
                    int32_t v; std::memcpy(&v, buf.data() + i, 4);
                    if (v == value) hits.push_back(r.base + off + i);
                }
            }
            off += want;
        }
    }
    return hits;
}

// ---------- 缩小范围：金币变了再扫，只留仍相等的 ----------

void NarrowScan(HANDLE h, std::vector<uintptr_t>& hits, int32_t value) {
    std::vector<uintptr_t> keep;
    keep.reserve(hits.size());
    for (uintptr_t a : hits) {
        int32_t v;
        if (ReadMem(h, a, v) && v == value) keep.push_back(a);
    }
    hits.swap(keep);
}

// ---------- 多级指针链解析 ----------

// 例: base=0x1400000, offsets={0x10, 0x2C, 0x8}
// 等价于: [[[base+0x10]+0x2C]+0x8]
uintptr_t ResolveChain(HANDLE h, uintptr_t base, const std::vector<uintptr_t>& offsets) {
    uintptr_t addr = base;
    for (size_t i = 0; i < offsets.size(); ++i) {
        uintptr_t next = 0;
        if (!ReadMem(h, addr, next)) return 0;
        addr = next + offsets[i];
    }
    return addr;
}
```

### 使用流程

1. **定位进程**：`FindPid(L"game.exe")`，用 `OpenProcess(PROCESS_VM_READ | PROCESS_VM_WRITE | PROCESS_VM_OPERATION | PROCESS_QUERY_INFORMATION, FALSE, pid)` 打开句柄。
2. **首次扫描**：记下当前金币，`FirstScan(h, gold)`，会返回一堆地址（通常几十到几万个）。
3. **缩小**：游戏里花掉/赚到金币让数值变化，`NarrowScan(h, hits, newGold)`；反复几次，直到剩 1~3 个地址。
4. **确认**：`WriteMem(h, hits[0], (int32_t)999999)`，看游戏里金币是否跳变。会跳变的就是它。
5. **做稳定链**：扫出来的地址每次重启游戏都会变（堆地址随机化）。要稳定就得找**静态指针路径**——用 Cheat Engine 的 Pointer Scan，从动态地址反推一条 `模块基址+偏移 → 指针 → 偏移 → …` 的链。拿到链后按 `ResolveChain` 解析，基址用 `GetModuleBase` 每次现取，这样重启后仍有效。

### 找到稳定的链（Cheat Engine 做法）

拿到唯一地址后：`右键 → Find out what accesses this address`，看访问它的指令，通常是 `mov rax,[rbx+0x2C]` 这种，说明结构体基址在 `rbx + 0x2C`。再对 `rbx` 做指针扫描（`Pointer scan for this address`），一层层往上，直到终点落在模块的静态区（如 `game.exe+0x3A0B12`）。得到的链写进 `ResolveChain` 的 `offsets`。

